---
// 4.3 — Release as open source
// Open source icon at top, benefits radiating below
---

<div class="oss-wrap">
  <div class="oss-header">
    <svg class="oss-logo" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 9.9-1"/><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
    </svg>
    <div class="oss-title">Open source</div>
  </div>

  <div class="oss-benefits">
    <div class="oss-benefit">
      <svg class="oss-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="m21 21l-4.34-4.34"/><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div class="oss-benefit-name">Transparency</div>
        <div class="oss-benefit-desc">Researchers can inspect what the code does to their data</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="oss-benefit">
      <svg class="oss-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <circle cx="12" cy="18" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"/><path d="M18 9v2c0 .6-.4 1-1 1H7c-.6 0-1-.4-1-1V9m6 3v3"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div class="oss-benefit-name">Continuity</div>
        <div class="oss-benefit-desc">Users can fork if the project is abandoned</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="oss-benefit">
      <svg class="oss-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/><rect width="20" height="8" x="2" y="14" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M6 6h.01M6 18h.01"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div class="oss-benefit-name">Accessibility</div>
        <div class="oss-benefit-desc">HPC clusters often can't run commercial software</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="oss-benefit">
      <svg class="oss-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696a10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0a1 1 0 0 1 0 .696a10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
      </svg>
      <div>
        <div class="oss-benefit-name">Reproducibility</div>
        <div class="oss-benefit-desc">Pinned versions require access to the source</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<style>
  .oss-wrap {
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--section-color, var(--accent-sage));
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .oss-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(230, 225, 216, 0.06);
  }

  .oss-logo {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    color: var(--section-color, var(--accent-sage));
  }

  .oss-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .oss-benefits {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .oss-benefit {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    padding: 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(107, 145, 122, 0.04);
  }

  .oss-icon {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--section-color, var(--accent-sage));
    margin-top: 1px;
  }

  .oss-benefit-name {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .oss-benefit-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .oss-note {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(230, 225, 216, 0.06);
    padding-top: var(--space-sm);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
